 "description": "Hourly or daily USD price points for one token reference (network:address) from DefiLlama's coin API, with the symbol and confidence it attaches to the series. Costs $0.001 USDC per call. Byte-identical to GET /market/llama-asset-price-history?ref=coingecko:bitcoin&period=1h&span=20.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
